Cell["\<\
When two tensors share an index but disagree on its dimension, \
IndexedMultiply broadcasts to the maximum \[LongDash] the smaller tensor is \
padded with 1s along that axis, so its entries fill into the wider result \
without contraction:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->159455405,ExpressionUUID->"ca78aca5-522a-4dcc-b8b1-159283a84c71"],

